  "summary": "Lightwell Security Advisory: quarkus-http-core 4.1.8.rhlw-00005",
  "details": "Red Hat Lightwell has released io.quarkus.http:quarkus-http-core 4.1.8.rhlw-00005 with backported fixes for CVE-2024-12397 and CVE-2024-3653.\n\nCVE-2024-12397: Io.quarkus.http/quarkus-http-core: quarkus http cookie smuggling\n\nCVE-2024-3653: Undertow: learningpushhandler can lead to remote memory dos attacks\n\nThis patched artifact is a drop-in replacement for io.quarkus.http:quarkus-http-core 4.1.8 from Maven Central.",
